comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T16:58:06.353Z",codex-root,Baseline has 614 passing unit tests plus a green e2e suite.
  "2026-07-16T17:18:34.876Z",codex-root,Release dry-run found stale calendar version 2026.3.6-3; version policy requires 2026.7.16 for the next release.
  "2026-07-16T17:22:15.180Z",codex-root,"Final local proof: frozen Bun install and npm install pass; bun audit reports no vulnerabilities; lint/build pass; 619 unit and 60 hermetic E2E tests pass; enforced coverage is above all floors."
  "2026-07-16T17:22:15.180Z",codex-root,Release dry-run passes for synchronized version 2026.7.16 and package smoke installs the tarball in an isolated temporary consumer through npm/npx and bunx under both bin names.
  "2026-07-16T17:22:15.180Z",codex-root,"Workflow and security proof: actionlint 1.7.12 passes, shellcheck passes, current-tree Gitleaks scans 12.12 MB with no leaks, and full-history secret scan passes."
  "2026-07-16T17:24:08.308Z",codex-root,"After final response-cancellation and IPv6-mapped-address hardening, release:dry-run passed again and the hermetic E2E suite passed all 60 tests."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T16:58:06.353Z",codex-root,Verification must run after the final tracker-relevant source mutation.
learnings[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T16:58:06.353Z",codex-root,Both Bun frozen-lock and npm peer-resolution paths are required because CI exercises both package managers.
  "2026-07-16T17:18:34.876Z",codex-root,"The release gate deliberately makes package metadata date-sensitive, so a comprehensive recovery must synchronize the calendar version before final proof."
  "2026-07-16T17:22:15.180Z",codex-root,"Bun 1.3.11 restores package.json after a version-sync script mutation; running the repository script directly synchronized the file, while the declared packageManager and hosted setup target Bun 1.3.14."
